      "root_cause_candidate": "The `flow_action_entry_next()` function in the netfilter flow table offload subsystem failed to validate if the number of actions exceeded the configured maximum limit before accessing the action array, allowing out-of-bounds memory writes when IPv6 flow rules required more than the hardcoded limit of 16 actions.",
      "evidence_points": ""
