        "change_category": "bug_fix",
        "intent_summary": "Fixes improper error handling and resource leaks by converting void functions to return error codes with proper cleanup on failure paths",
        "what": "Changed flow_offload_redirect from void to int return type with specific error codes (-EOPNOTSUPP, -ENODEV, -E2BIG), added NULL check for entry with dev_put cleanup, and changed flow_offload_encap_tunnel signature from void to int",
        "how": "Enables callers to detect and handle specific failure conditions instead of silent failures, ensures proper resource cleanup (dev_put) when entry allocation fails, and propagates error codes up the call stack for better error handling"
      }
    },
